---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Neurinlab"
  description="Neurinlab studies and experiments with ways to use fast tools while keeping our thinking our own."
  lang="en"
  current="about"
>
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Where Neurinlab Begins</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Making Space to Think for Ourselves</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy compact">
        Neurinlab studies and experiments with ways to use fast tools<br />
        while keeping our thinking our own.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section">
    <div class="section-inner split-grid">
      <h2 class="section-title">The Question Behind Neurinlab</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        AI makes it easier to produce answers, drafts, and summaries.
        But when the answer arrives before we have really stayed with the question,
        it can become harder to know what we actually think. Neurinlab begins there.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="info-card">
          <h2>AI and Thinking</h2>
          <p>Answers arrive quickly, but the question can become less clear. We start by staying with what we actually want to ask.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h2>Writing in Our Own Words</h2>
          <p>It is easier than ever to generate sentences. We return to fast drafts and shape them until the words feel like ours.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h2>Ideas and Tools</h2>
          <p>Ideas can pile up before they become useful. We gather scattered thoughts into structure and connect them to the next step.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
